OL,5,G1955 Grand Designs
OL,6,     FJoe and Lina are fed up with
OL,7,     Frenting but can't afford to buy.
OL,8,     FSo they're building their own
OL,9,     Fclever, space-saving two-bedroom
OL,10,     Fhome for #160,000, on a tiny plot
OL,11,     Fin east London.
OL,12,G2100 The Reclaimers: Made in...
OL,13,     F...Suffolk: Brand new series -
